  "details": "Ability to bind quick world selection to keys like Alt-1 to 9 (probably might have to be like Ctrl-shift-alt-1 to 9) to prevent ou from accidental presses, it will promt you if you are sure you want to travel.\n\nYou can customise them in your menu panel to set them to send you to any public instance or your own Private instance. You can use up to 9 of your favourited worlds. So it’s a quick way to instantly set off to worlds without using the menu.\n\nThis is Another form of quick access and this can also be implemented for avatars too with a different key bind such as the number pad, once for selecting and once again to confirm up to 9 of your favourited avatars or those that you uploaded (not all keypads have num pads so another alternative binding can be found)\n\nThis is great for desktop users.",
